  "checked_rows": 34,
  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00001",
      "text": "■《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律施行规则》〔附页第6号格式〕<2021年7月12日修订>",
      "source_hash": "08a47732f2a28e1a3eb0dc31586091e056ea3ce6be1f7d46f040893045e49276",
      "target_id": "XML:1802884"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00002",
      "text": "[ ] 智慧创新事业",
      "source_hash": "e4b6c2bae4c5c1b1984fd53300838d75995dc14098b6b7dc02621f3cc9021b24",
      "target_id": "XML:1802885"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00003",
      "text": "延期申请书",
      "source_hash": "1a467adca5e33119a3a7404c157dadbd731761aeaaf5b03d085805ce7e6321bb",
      "target_id": "XML:1802886"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00004",
      "text": "[ ] 智慧实证事业",
      "source_hash": "7a0b9bef1f76ba0d4ac192b1bf7ccb617b105e598dc5c034283cb5fc1b200bca",
      "target_id": "XML:1802887"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00005",
      "text": "※ 深色栏由申请人留空，并在[ ]内对应选项处标注√。（正面）",
      "source_hash": "c20e97d732d34ae7d88e40b5b31c8fa9bdfc507be8d615a4da47703ff00c0397",
      "target_id": "XML:1802888"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00006",
      "text": "（正面）",
      "source_hash": "9c2cff79a84df6db8a038d4803908bc9bd951c982152400d044ce6c5b3292004",
      "target_id": "XML:1802889"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00009",
      "text": "受理日期",
      "source_hash": "ebc9b96eb63cf003b7b1fc13d77fd353ced43869ee6c7836a9f3be4c588e1391",
      "target_id": "XML:1802892"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00011",
      "text": "法人名称（姓名）",
      "source_hash": "9444b0a00a812f655b27d369eb4c26c19b67484b28bc7411ca01f82e11d76532",
      "target_id": "XML:1802894"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00020",
      "text": "主要内容",
      "source_hash": "55fa9f20eb47cc9f9fe2ca2fc9f80c7019fceed7ed10fb6567a7f997c1f14f7b",
      "target_id": "XML:1802903"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00024",
      "text": "适用规制特例及规制改善的对象法律法规",
      "source_hash": "085bbf8840b5bd20723df5fabce60dd5b8b6f9c387e0d30624a1e9f6a8ca316c",
      "target_id": "XML:1802908"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00025",
      "text": "实施地区",
      "source_hash": "346942363717a71392645e0800f71648288e74afc376e473e6350381fef9c8f8",
      "target_id": "XML:1802909"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00026",
      "text": "特例条件",
      "source_hash": "177c9759b162af824022de6bb975a2c5fb3326a52e03b10ec748379b3af5698f",
      "target_id": "XML:1802910"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00027",
      "text": "※ 依据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第四十九条第八款，国土交通部长官为确保环境、安全、卫生等",
      "source_hash": "f68363a0333caceae3d4093fbaf3518e9aaa77554239c0b8b44f5e1891b82100",
      "target_id": "XML:1802911"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00028",
      "text": "而附加条件时，应填写该等条件。",
      "source_hash": "50aec19d11c8dd9a30947989fac05bd5449b6d657a2d28fbb816b2df582ee4ce",
      "target_id": "XML:1802912"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00029",
      "text": "实施期间或",
      "source_hash": "c93957b6961db22e8041e782e4006303c7b334aadc5449fdca4ee32c2b699f0f",
      "target_id": "XML:1802913"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00030",
      "text": "实证期间延期",
      "source_hash": "dfe727bb098eaccf1d3dcaf3e953334b6888a94ee401a7fe1bb87d516068cd53",
      "target_id": "XML:1802914"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00031",
      "text": "原因及期间",
      "source_hash": "6ec2bd4b92d4d3f6f60e7f625a827ac2235b53dc1a22552ef2f0dfecc88e0f5d",
      "target_id": "XML:1802915"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00032",
      "text": "延期原因",
      "source_hash": "f33d3f255620021195201f45662c7968424dd4c708a6d2b93090d57a720d1040",
      "target_id": "XML:1802916"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00033",
      "text": "申请延长的期间",
      "source_hash": "139545e51f6aa50a9ade2f85b574b21e3053678fa86d56f05f69bcf807c4b1f7",
      "target_id": "XML:1802917"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00039",
      "text": "依据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第五十一条第二款正文、第五十三条之三第一款、该法施行令第五十四条",
      "source_hash": "bc81933bbce3074f732413ef738a9c5cdd7ca5395df93ea43d5c1512f4e664e0",
      "target_id": "XML:1802923"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00040",
      "text": "第三款及该法施行规则第五条第一款，现按上述内容申请[ ]",
      "source_hash": "b6fb97fcbcd88a0fcb8889c54d4d63913e90d756a01f1876e919fd92167b2a3a",
      "target_id": "XML:1802924"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00041",
      "text": "智慧创新事业 [ ]",
      "source_hash": "62ee9a8cce92e5f57d502b9c27547d49eb477a95b2c77b6067f044b2aa948940",
      "target_id": "XML:1802925"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00042",
      "text": "智慧实证事业的实施期间",
      "source_hash": "4267647a6a51f00339752424bd9c5330ba1426db8c0ec0a598b5eda02599f303",
      "target_id": "XML:1802926"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00043",
      "text": "或实证期间延期。",
      "source_hash": "bc82d31a88502ad1645b15e35285e3af7f8036a9dbcd4b093f2cad5a5f19fbb1",
      "target_id": "XML:1802927"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00052",
      "text": "1. 相关智慧创新事业计划或智慧实证事业计划的批准确认书副本",
      "source_hash": "fb1be88d05d2cd66b3674a4dc0dca35d3889a9952c06578656485edf4dc66457",
      "target_id": "XML:1802936"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00053",
      "text": "2. 相关智慧创新事业或智慧实证事业的延期理由说明书",
      "source_hash": "41be07816f354c540eb84cdf36deede8e4fd3dece979e5854e2bcaca1eb52305",
      "target_id": "XML:1802937"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00054",
      "text": "3. 依据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第五十三条第三款适用规制特例及实施事业的结果",
      "source_hash": "3023112da515bd9013e47356a5b4131935869b46bcab3a8419016ec754a4499d",
      "target_id": "XML:1802938"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00055",
      "text": "或依据该法第五十三条之二第二款适用规制特例及实证的结果",
      "source_hash": "0bde4e9a0c9e7b8f7bf7381ed353ea33ab8a2ee8b8999c48387d3de8367092fe",
      "target_id": "XML:1802939"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00057",
      "text": "5. 延长责任保险的保险期间或变更损害赔偿的计划书",
      "source_hash": "52243e4e1e3f789e1dab4966ebf6ed8fc6df84a0142165dfa55ac71b7d10e738",
      "target_id": "XML:1802941"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00058",
      "text": "6. 延长实施期间或实证期间所需的其他事项",
      "source_hash": "9f148b7ef82f9b97a234e7ddf61c8bcfa0e1d7b3a29ef400e5d2845721aea908",
      "target_id": "XML:1802942"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00065",
      "text": "受理",
      "source_hash": "d995d6ab415d91d191bafde064de400b1e66d82532d91ec0cc02d72258ce5cda",
      "target_id": "XML:1802950"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00069",
      "text": "通知是否批准",
      "source_hash": "e07df84488a0a4ba254c11d8de9959b5dfbf5a95e6444492a3f2438671bc0542",
      "target_id": "XML:1802954"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00070",
      "text": "审批（签发延期确认书）",
      "source_hash": "0a71de9f52bdc9d9e04f10d58fdf79e7e7b33cd6b6b58880178d2f5f4368cc8b",
      "target_id": "XML:1802955"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25470-zh-00071",
      "text": "公告",
      "source_hash": "d5454017e73d2c297fac0a5d6f72f9377addc44895a7e1141260a6ce5ed4cfc6",
      "target_id": "XML:1802956"
    }
  ],
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
